@*Importing the web components is what tells the Razor compiler how the HTML elements of a card take part in
  binding and in events: without it a control compiles with its @bind and @on... attributes left as markup,
  which fails the build for a bound field and silently leaves the fields of a card inert.*@
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Web
@using Blazor.WorkflowEditor.Components
@using WorkflowEditor.TestActivities
